llm_calls.content:
{
  "selected_feature_id": 2,
  "rationale": "Marital status adds broadly stable signal about household formation and labor-force attachment beyond age, education, disability, and military service. It is generally predictive across states while being less tied to geography-specific composition or protected-status shortcuts than race, sex, ancestry, nativity, or migration."
}

