{
  "selected_feature_id": 13,
  "rationale": "Vision difficulty adds stable, individual-level information about functional limitation that is directly relevant to employment across states and is less likely than ancestry, race, migration, or family-structure proxies to encode geography-specific or demographic shortcut effects. It complements already selected disability-related features by capturing a distinct impairment dimension not fully covered by general disability status."
}

